    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collātĭcĭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conl-</span></b> ) or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		confero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>brought together</i>, <i>raised by
				contribution</i>, <i>mingled</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">instrumenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Cons. ad Marc. 10, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stipe,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 213, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">myrrha,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 16, 35, § 69</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Val. 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sepultura,</span>”
				<i>effected by contributions</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. Decl. 6, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">PECVNIA,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 3730</span></i>
			.</div>
